## 🧩 Updated Grammar

```
<memory-block> ::= <header> <payload> <auth>? <filters>? <checksum>

<header>       ::= "MEM" <version> <target-len>
<version>      ::= 0x01
<target-len>   ::= 0x11

<payload>      ::= <uri-type> <namespace> <repository>
<uri-type>     ::= 0x47 0x49 0x54              ; "GIT"
<namespace>    ::= 0x6D 0x65 0x72 0x63 0x77 0x61 0x72 ; "mercwar"
<repository>   ::= 0x2A                        ; wildcard (*)

; -------------------------
; NEW OPTIONAL SECTIONS
