<auth>         ::= <auth-tag> <auth-len> <auth-bytes>
<auth-tag>     ::= 0xA1
<auth-len>     ::= 1-byte length of <auth-bytes>
<auth-bytes>   ::= 0x00…FF (raw token bytes)

<filters>      ::= <filter-tag> <filter-len> <filter-bytes>
<filter-tag>   ::= 0xB2
<filter-len>   ::= 1-byte length of <filter-bytes>
<filter-bytes> ::= <filter-rule>+

<filter-rule>  ::= <rule-type> <rule-len> <rule-data>

<rule-type>    ::= 0x01  ; include by prefix
                  | 0x02 ; exclude by prefix
                  | 0x03 ; include by filetype
                  | 0x04 ; exclude by filetype
                  | 0x05 ; include by regex-id
                  | 0x06 ; exclude by regex-id

<rule-len>     ::= 1-byte length of <rule-data>
<rule-data>    ::= raw bytes (UTF‑8)
```

